            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SweetBasil"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband said, \"That's potato soup!\" I did not puree the potatoes as we like a little more chunky consistancy, and they were already falling apart a bit anyway. Wonderful flavor and so comforting on a cold, rainy night!",
            "datePublished": "2005-01-11T17:00:39.123Z"
          },
          {
