            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "An excellent and flavorful soup. I've made it several times without the meat and substituting water for the broth for a vegetarian alternative. I also added several cloves of garlic and extra red and green and also yellow pepper. Yummy every time, thanks!",
